{"id":46203,"date":"2025-11-01T21:22:51","date_gmt":"2025-11-01T20:22:51","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=46203"},"modified":"2026-08-23T23:17:09","modified_gmt":"2026-08-23T22:17:09","slug":"cherry-winter-run-paul-2025","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/cherry-winter-run-paul-2025\/","title":{"rendered":"Cherry Winter Run &#8211; Paul 2025"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">1\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o &#8220;Cherry Winter Run &#8211; Paul 2025. A Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Cultural Desportiva do Paul, vai promover pela primeira vez, na freguesia do Paul, uma Corrida de Atletismo.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Num dos locais mais planos da vertente Sul do concelho da Covilh\u00e3, vai realizar-se pela primeira vez, uma corrida de estrada, que promete muita emo\u00e7\u00e3o num incr\u00edvel ambiente e j\u00e1 com um esp\u00edrito natal\u00edcio.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Um evento que conta com provas para todas as idades e g\u00e9neros. A fant\u00e1stica corrida da pequenada (Cherry Kids Run), benjamins a CHERRY ONE MILE e a sempre competitiva prova principal com a dist\u00e2ncia de 10km num percurso de 2 voltas, r\u00e1pido para bater os teus recordes.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Em simult\u00e2neo, vai para a estrada e com passagem por alguns dos trilhos da Freguesia do Paul, a caminhada onde todos os participantes podem desfrutar das belas e incr\u00edveis paisagens da ribeira do Paul.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":46204,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,28,478,624],"event_type_2":[535,727],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-46203","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-paul-covilha","event_type-corrida","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type-corridas-inferior-10","event_type-kids","event_type_2-castelo-branco","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/CherryWinterRun-25-Cartaz.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/46203","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=46203"}],"version-history":[{"count":1,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/46203\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":62262,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/46203\/revisions\/62262"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/46204"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=46203"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=46203"},{"taxonomy":"event_type","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type?post=46203"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_2","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type_2?post=46203"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_3","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type_3?post=46203"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_4","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type_4?p